	(text "LOW VOLTAGE ONLY: 5 V to 24 V DC. No mains on any terminal.\nJP1 1-2: J2 feeds the loads. JP1 2-3: the Pi 5 V feeds them,\n300 mA at most (assumed). Only one source reaches V_IN.\nD1 blocks a reversed supply. D2 clamps spikes on V_PROT;\nits 26 V standoff stays above 24 V + 5 % = 25.2 V. It clamps\nnear 42 V at its rated pulse (to verify): D1, D4, Q1,\nF1 and F2 are rated 60 V, C1 and C9 50 V.\nF1 limits a short on V_SW. Footprints of F1, F2: none in the\nstock library, to add in the board step."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 80.01 0)
		(effects
